#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:1 docs/concepts/notifications.md:5
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:359
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "通知"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:8
msgid ""
"PG-backed in-app inbox for **user** and **agent** subjects (entity model). "
"Cron results, task due reminders, and LLM tools write here; Shell UI lists "
"and marks read via SAP."
msgstr ""
"面向 **user** 与 **agent** 主体（实体模型）的 PG 应用内收件箱。Cron 结果、任"
"务到期提醒与 LLM 工具写入此处；Shell UI 通过 SAP 列出并标记已读。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recipients"
msgstr "收件人"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:12
msgid ""
"Configure subject entity ids in `config.yaml` **`worlds`** section (SSOT; "
"legacy `notifications` still read as fallback):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"worlds:\n"
"  user_subject_id: 1 # type=user entity; default 1\n"
"  agent_subject_id: 2 # type=agent entity; default 2\n"
msgstr ""
"worlds:\n"
"  user_subject_id: 1 # type=user entity; default 1\n"
"  agent_subject_id: 2 # type=agent entity; default 2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:20
msgid ""
"`user_world_id` / `agent_world_id` are derived at Hub boot from each "
"subject's `default_private_world_id` (see [`entity-model.md`](entity-"
"model.md))."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:22
msgid ""
"Each row stores `recipient_kind` (`user` | `agent`) and `recipient_id` "
"(entity id string). Unconfigured installs default to subject ids `1` / `2`."
msgstr ""
"每行存储 `recipient_kind`（`user` | `agent`）与 `recipient_id`（实体 id 字符"
"串）。未配置的安装默认使用 subject id `1` / `2`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Writer                                  | Typical recipient     |\n"
"| --------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n"
"| Cron success (when `notify_on_success`) | **both** user + agent |\n"
"| Cron failure                            | **both** user + agent |\n"
"| Task due reminder                       | agent                 |\n"
"| `notification_send` tool                | user / agent / both   |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 写入方                                  | 典型收件人            |\n"
"| --------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n"
"| Cron 成功（当 `notify_on_success`）     | **both** user + agent |\n"
"| Cron 失败                               | **both** user + agent |\n"
"| 任务到期提醒                            | agent                 |\n"
"| `notification_send` 工具                | user / agent / both   |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:31
msgid "Dream pipeline **does not** create notifications (reminder removed)."
msgstr "梦境流水线**不会**创建通知（提醒已移除）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent consciousness"
msgstr "Agent 意识"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:35
msgid ""
"Unread agent notifications are injected at inference time — same splice "
"point and transport as [fridge magnets](fridge-magnet.md): a runtime-only "
"**`assistant(name=notification_context)`** turn immediately before the last "
"`user` message. They are **not** persisted in conversation messages."
msgstr ""
"未读的 agent 通知在推理时注入——与[冰箱贴便签](fridge-magnet.md)相同的拼接点与"
"传输方式：在最后一条 `user` 消息之前插入仅运行时的 "
"**`assistant(name=notification_context)`** 轮次。它们**不会**持久化到对话消息"
"中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:37
msgid ""
"The inject block includes a **Handling protocol** (three-way triage by "
"whether action is needed — not by `source_kind`)."
msgstr "注入块包含**处理协议**（按是否需要行动三分流——而非按 `source_kind`）。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent handling protocol"
msgstr "Agent 处理协议"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:41
msgid ""
"For each injected `[id:…]` line, classify by content (not by writer/source):"
msgstr "对每条注入的 `[id:…]` 行，按内容分类（而非按写入方/来源）："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Category                          | Action                          | Mark read                                       |\n"
"| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Informational only**            | Acknowledge in reply if useful  | Batch `notification_mark_read({ ids: [...] })`  |\n"
"| **Action needed, quick**          | Handle within ~3 tool rounds    | `notification_mark_read` that id after done     |\n"
"| **Action needed, slow/uncertain** | Ask the user before a long task | Do **not** mark read until approved and handled |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 类别                              | 行动                            | 标记已读                                        |\n"
"| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **仅信息**                        | 若有帮助则在回复中确认          | 批量 `notification_mark_read({ ids: [...] })`   |\n"
"| **需行动，可快速完成**            | 约 3 轮工具内处理               | 完成后对该 id 调用 `notification_mark_read`     |\n"
"| **需行动，耗时/不确定**           | 长任务前先询问用户              | 批准并处理前**不要**标记已读                    |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:49
msgid ""
"Unmarked unread items are re-injected on the next user turn. Use "
"`notification_list(recipient=agent, read_filter=unread)` if the inject block "
"is truncated."
msgstr ""
"未标记已读的未读项会在下一轮 user 时重新注入。若注入块被截断，使用 "
"`notification_list(recipient=agent, read_filter=unread)`。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task reminder scan"
msgstr "任务提醒扫描"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:53
msgid ""
"Builtin cron `builtin-task-reminders` runs **every minute** (`* * * * *`)."
msgstr "内置 cron `builtin-task-reminders` **每分钟**运行（`* * * * *`）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:55
msgid "For each pending `task_item`:"
msgstr "对每个待处理的 `task_item`："

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:59
msgid "**Trigger time**: `remind_at` if set, else `due_at`; if neither, skip."
msgstr ""
"**触发时间**：若设置了 `remind_at` 则用之，否则 `due_at`；两者皆无则跳过。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:59
msgid ""
"**Send** when `trigger <= now` and `last_notified_at` is absent or "
"`last_notified_at < trigger` (entity JSONB field on schedulable body)."
msgstr ""
"**发送**条件：`trigger <= now` 且 `last_notified_at` 缺失或 "
"`last_notified_at < trigger`（可调度 body 上的实体 JSONB 字段）。"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:59
msgid ""
"**After send**: patch `last_notified_at` on the task entity; do not rely on "
"day-based `source_ref` dedup alone."
msgstr ""
"**发送后**：在任务实体上 patch `last_notified_at`；不要仅依赖基于日的 "
"`source_ref` 去重。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Product rule (confirmed)**: one trigger per task per scan — **remind first, else due**; not separate notifications for both when both are set.\n"
msgstr "**产品规则（已确认）**：每次扫描每个任务仅一次触发——**先 remind，否则 due**；两者皆设时不分别发送两条通知。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:63
msgid ""
"Task reminders are delivered via this inbox (ToolSet `task` / cron), not by "
"`notification_send` duplicating the same reminder."
msgstr ""
"任务提醒经此收件箱投递（ToolSet `task` / cron），而非 `notification_send` 重"
"复同一提醒。"

